 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_271.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}在这里学到了不少东西，\n回到八十稻羽以后，\n搜查也还要继续……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_271.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3D 04}也许是个好机会呢。\n可以换个新心情，重新投入搜查。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_271.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 03}像是画个阶段性的句号？\n张弛有度很重要呢，嗯。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_271.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A0 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}你们的意思我懂，\n但我坚决反对！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_271.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8B 05}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}蛋包饭庆功宴那种事，\n我可不想再来第二次。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
